{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/output.schema.json",
    "title": "AssessmentBatch.v1 核验输出合同",
    "summary": "该 JSON Schema 规定 verifier 批量核验结果的顶层身份、逐提案字段、摘要格式和判定枚举，形成严格的数据交换边界，但未定义各 reason_code 的受控词表。",
    "category": "requirements",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "batch_shape",
        "title": "批次身份与严格结构",
        "body": "合同采用 JSON Schema 2020-12，并将对象限制为不得出现额外属性。顶层必须包含版本、任务标识、固定为 `verifier` 的角色标识以及 assessments 数组；版本常量为 1。[[c1]] 这使宿主能够把输出绑定到具体任务和角色，并拒绝字段漂移，但材料只展示合同定义，没有展示验证器是否在持久化或消费前实际执行该 Schema。"
      },
      {
        "key": "assessment_semantics",
        "title": "单项核验的双重判定",
        "body": "每项 assessment 必须携带提案标识、64 位小写十六进制摘要、引文或资产判定、语义判定、原因代码、解释和缺失上下文。[[c2]] 引文层判定区分有效、无效和歧义；语义层仅允许“支持、矛盾、证据不足、需要限定范围”四种结果。[[c3]]\n\n这种分离避免把定位正确直接等同于语义支持，也允许明确记录缺失背景。限制是 `reason_code` 目前仅约束为任意字符串，`reason` 与 `missing_context` 也没有长度或词表约束，跨实现的一致性仍依赖额外约定。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "AssessmentBatch 顶层结构",
        "reason": "支持 Schema 版本、禁止额外字段、必填顶层字段及固定角色身份的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 12
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://omem.invalid/contracts/AssessmentBatch.v1\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"schema_version\", \"job_id\", \"role_id\", \"assessments\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"schema_version\": { \"const\": 1 },\n    \"job_id\": { "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "逐提案核验必填字段",
        "reason": "支持每项 assessment 的标识、摘要、双重 verdict、原因与缺失上下文字段要求。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 13,
          "endLine": 27
        },
        "quote": "      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\n          \"proposal_id\",\n          \"proposal_digest\",\n          \"quote_asset_verdict\",\n          \"semantic_verdict\",\n          \"reason_code\",\n          \"reason\",\n          \"missing_context\"\n        ],\n        \"proper"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "核验判定枚举",
        "reason": "支持引文或资产判定与语义判定各自允许的状态集合。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 28,
          "endLine": 34
        },
        "quote": "          \"quote_asset_verdict\": { \"enum\": [\"valid\", \"invalid\", \"ambiguous\"] },\n          \"semantic_verdict\": {\n            \"enum\": [\"supported\", \"contradicted\", \"insufficient\", \"needs_scope\"]\n          },\n          \"reason_code\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"reason\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"missing_contex"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "reason_code 是否存在未在本 Schema 中体现的规范词表？",
        "why": "当前合同只要求字符串；若生产者自由命名，统计、重试和自动路由可能产生不一致。",
        "nextStep": "查明消费端实际依赖的原因代码，并决定将其加入枚举、独立版本化词表或明确保持开放扩展。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
